### Initial Checks

- [X] I confirm that I'm using Pydantic V2

### Description

JSON Schema Draft 2020-12 explains the way to display optional (nullable) values.

https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/json-schema-core.html#section-7.6.1-3

Example:

```
{
    "type": ["string", "null"],
    "maxLength": 255
}
```

But pydantic v2 displays it like:

```
{
    "anyOf": [
        {
            "type": "string"
        },
        {
            "type": "null"
        }
    ],
}
```

The variant with `anyOf` displays strange in ReDoc For example
